WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.979
Slice one point three checks every change to Christian Fitness before it reaches

00:00:06.979 --> 00:00:07.590
main.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.232
Push to main, or open a pull request, and GitHub Actions starts two jobs side by

00:00:13.232 --> 00:00:17.652
side. Each checks out only its own folder, and needs no secret.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.444
The frontend job installs, lints, checks the format and builds both apps within

00:00:22.444 --> 00:00:23.531
their budgets.

00:00:23.731 --> 00:00:27.957
Then the Playwright behaviour specs run in Chromium, with the shared fixture

00:00:27.957 --> 00:00:29.591
answering every request.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.090
The backend job builds with warnings as errors, then runs the acceptance tests

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:38.131
through the API, on an in-memory database.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.716
Caches keep npm, NuGet and the browser between runs. Warm, the whole run takes under

00:00:45.716 --> 00:00:49.418
forty seconds, and each job stops at five minutes.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.650
To prove it, lint was broken on purpose. The run failed at the lint step, naming the

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:56.279
line, and stopped there.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.823
Then a compiler warning, a wrong page title and a closed health check. Each failed

00:01:04.823 --> 00:01:07.534
at its own step, and nothing was retried.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.290
Put back, both jobs are green again.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:24.980
That's slice one point three. Christian Fitness: a Christian community for health in

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:26.229
body and spirit.
